      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Start and settings\n\nRuns at 9:00 on weekdays. **Settings** is the one node to change: who to look for, where, how many, what you do and why you want to connect."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "48adbfac-7861-4c38-9bd8-07ac6f71d5f7",
      "name": "Find the people",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 660,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Find the people\n\nSearches LinkedIn by your words and place, turns the list into one item per person, and leaves out anyone without a profile link. The HTTP Request node needs your **Bearer Auth** credential."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0b8f42cf-a0d7-46bb-aff1-40e0e80fa39b",
      "name": "Write and ask",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1100,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Write the note and ask, one person at a time\n\nThe chat model writes a note for this person. You get the person and the note in Slack with **Send it** and **Skip**, and the workflow waits for your answer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4f1cb957-6d44-4317-8d90-60545c221e1e",
      "name": "Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1820,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Send, then the next person\n\nOnly after **Send it**. The invitation goes out from your own LinkedIn account, then the workflow pauses before the next person."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
